{{Enemy Infobox|Cultist}}'''The Cultist''' is a normal [[Monsters|Enemy]] that can show up in all 3 Acts.

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|Cultist}}

Always starts with {{Int|Cultist|Incantation}}, then uses {{Int|Cultist|Dark Strike}} every turn after.

== In Party With ==

=== Act 1 ===
As an easy pool encounter:

* Solo

As half of an Exordium Thugs encounter in the hard pool:

* 1 {{M|Acid Slime (M)}}
* 1 {{M|Spike Slime (M)}}
* 1 {{M|Green Louse}}
* 1 {{M|Red Louse}}

=== Act 2 ===
In the hard pool alongside:

* 2 other Cultists
* 1 {{M|Chosen}}

=== Act 3 ===
In the {{M|Awakened One}} boss fight, alongside:
* 1 other Cultist

== Lore ==
They are strongly implied to worship the crow god Mazaleth, and implied to have a connection to the {{M|Chosen}} and {{M|Awakened One}}. Their {{R|Cultist Headpiece|Headpiece}} can be acquired in the {{E|Face Trader}} event. The {{P|Cultist Potion}}, which grants the player 1 {{KW|Ritual}}, is a reference to this enemy.


At the Act 2 [[Event]] {{E|The Nest}}, a bit of their mode of operation can be gleaned.

<blockquote>
A long line of <span class="defect-text">hooded figures</span> can be seen entering an 
<span class="watcher-text">unassuming cathedral</span>.

Naturally, you join the line and are quickly surrounded by <span class="ironclad-text">Cultists!</span>

They ignore you as they gleefully chant and wave their weapons around.

Cultists: <span class="ironclad-text">"MURDER!! MURDER MURDER!!"</span>

Cultists: <span class="defect-text">"CAW CAW CAAAAAWWW!"</span>

Cultists: <span class="ironclad-text">"MURDER! MURDER MUURDER!!"</span>

Cultists: <span class="defect-text">"CAAW CAW CAAAAAAWW!!"</span>

You eye a <span class="rare-font">Donation Box... </span>
</blockquote>

<blockquote>
You decide to stay in line (out of fear) to see what will happen.

Eventually, you are face-to-face with the leader. A well-dressed cultist hands you an 
<span class="rare-font">Ornate Dagger.</span> Like the others before you, you slash your forearm and let the blood drip into a misshapen bowl.

The cultists chant and holler for you!

Cultists: <span class="defect-text">"CAAW CAW CAAAAAAWW!!"</span>

You chant, too. Why not?
</blockquote>

* The most comprehensive lore regarding Cultists was put together by TiberiusEsuriens <ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/slaythespire/comments/lwc6tu/connecting_lore_birds/</ref>


== Trivia ==
* They are the only enemy that can appear in every standard Act (Act 1, Act 2, and Act 3).

* Cultists appear in the artwork of {{C|Immolate}}, {{C|Sash Whip}}, {{C|Vault}} and {{C|Swift Strike}}. They are also found in the [[Beta Art]] of several cards including {{C|Prostrate}}, {{C|Disarm}}, and {{C|Choke}}.

